SUMMARY:Remembrance Service
DESCRIPTION:As you’ve passed by Calvary Baptist\, have you wondered about the Memorial Stained Glass Window? Made up of fragments of stained glass retrieved from church windows during World War II\, each Remembrance Service we describe the provenance of one fragment. The balcony will be open before and after the service for closer viewing of the Memorial Window\, and the descriptive book “Broken Glass” will be available for purchase.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/remembrance-service/
LOCATION:Calvary Baptist Church\, 72 Main St.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
